{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>תמים תהיה עם ה׳ אלקיך.</b> An expression of wholeness. Do not say: I will fear one fear and another with Him, as we find with the converts of the lions, about whom it is written: ״את ה׳ היו יראים ואת אלהיהם היו עובדים,״ so that you would turn out lacking in the fear of Him. Rather, be like a full vessel — complete, of one substance, meaning: be whole with Him in all your deeds and in all your thoughts. And of this Solomon said in his wisdom: ״בכל דרכיך דעהו״ etc."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:53:19.557537395Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}